---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● ARDMORE &amp; SOUTHERN OKLAHOMA · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>AC REPAIR<br />IN <span>ARDMORE</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Cooling. Real Relief. Same-Day Service.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When your air conditioner fails in Ardmore, every hot hour counts. Our licensed technicians are on call around the clock — delivering expert repairs, upfront pricing, and workmanship backed by a written guarantee for every home in the Ardmore area.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">❄️</div>
          <h3>No Cool Air?</h3>
          <p>We diagnose and repair central AC, heat pumps, and ductless systems the same day in most cases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Ardmore Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Oklahoma summers are brutal. When your AC struggles, you need a licensed local specialist who responds the same day and repairs it right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Diagnosis &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most same-day AC repair calls in Ardmore are completed within hours of your call — no multi-day waits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Certified</h3>
          <p>Every technician is licensed, insured, and trained on central air, heat pumps, mini-splits, and all major brands common in southern Oklahoma.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we wrench. No hidden fees, no upsell pressure — just honest AC repair at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Ardmore</h3>
          <p>Based in Ardmore — we know the housing stock, common brands (Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem), and Oklahoma climate demands.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">47 min</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Avg. Response</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">98%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">First-Visit Fix Rate</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-value">24/7</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Emergency Available</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize These <span>Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Oklahoma heat and humidity accelerate AC wear. If your system shows any of these symptoms, don't wait.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/no-cool-air/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>No Cool Air</h3>
          <p>Warm air from vents often means low refrigerant, failed compressor, or clogged filters. Same-day service restores comfort fast.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/ac-not-turning-on/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>AC Not Turning On</h3>
          <p>No power or response can signal a bad capacitor, thermostat, or electrical issue. Act before the heat builds up.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/strange-noises/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Strange Noises</h3>
          <p>Grinding, squealing, or banging usually means worn bearings, loose parts, or failing motors. Early repair prevents bigger damage.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/weak-airflow/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Weak Airflow</h3>
          <p>Reduced airflow points to dirty filters, blocked ducts, or blower problems that strain the system.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/high-energy-bills/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>High Energy Bills</h3>
          <p>A sudden spike often means the system is working harder due to low refrigerant, dirty coils, or aging components.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/frozen-evaporator/" class="problem-card">
          <span class="problem-label urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Frozen Evaporator Coil</h3>
          <p>Ice on the indoor coil restricts cooling and can damage the compressor. Needs prompt diagnosis and repair.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services preview -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert AC <span>Repair Services</span></h2>
        <p>Every cooling problem has a root cause. Our certified technicians diagnose accurately and repair correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Urgent Response</span>
          <h3>Emergency AC Repair</h3>
          <p>When cooling fails at the worst moment, we respond around the clock — no after-hours surcharge surprises.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Available 24 / 7</li>
            <li>Avg. response under 60 min</li>
            <li>Stocked service vehicles</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Most Common</span>
          <h3>AC System Repair</h3>
          <p>Central air &amp; heat pumps. Capacitors, contactors, compressors, coils, and full diagnostics for all major brands.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>All major brands</li>
            <li>Written estimate first</li>
            <li>Same-visit repairs</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Modern Systems</span>
          <h3>Ductless Mini-Split</h3>
          <p>Error codes, refrigerant, inverter boards, and zone control repair for Mitsubishi, Fujitsu, Daikin, and more.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Brand specialists</li>
            <li>Single &amp; multi-zone</li>
            <li>Same-visit when possible</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ductless-mini-split/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Critical</span>
          <h3>Refrigerant Leak Repair</h3>
          <p>Locate the source fast — coils, lines, or fittings — and restore charge properly without shortcuts.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Electronic leak detection</li>
            <li>Proper EPA recovery</li>
            <li>Honest repair vs replace</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/refrigerant-leak-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Preventive</span>
          <h3>AC Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Tune-ups, coil cleaning, and filter service extend system life and lower energy use through Oklahoma summers.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full system inspection</li>
            <li>Coil &amp; drain cleaning</li>
            <li>Performance testing</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-maintenance/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <span class="service-label">Replacement</span>
          <h3>AC Installation</h3>
          <p>Code-compliant central or ductless installs sized correctly for Ardmore homes and Oklahoma climate.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Same-day installs often available</li>
            <li>Load calculation &amp; sizing</li>
            <li>Workmanship warranty</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-installation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Restore Your <span>Cool Air</span></h2>
        <p>Every Ardmore AC repair follows a structured, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Scheduling &amp; Same-Day Response</h3>
          <p>Call or text. We confirm your appointment quickly — often offering same-day slots. We gather a brief symptom overview so the technician arrives prepared.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Precision Diagnostic Inspection</h3>
          <p>We test capacitors, contactors, refrigerant pressures, airflow, and electrical components. Problems are identified with instruments, not assumptions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Honest Findings &amp; Repair Options</h3>
          <p>Before any work begins, your technician explains exactly what was found in plain language. You receive a clear written estimate. No pressure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Skilled Repair</h3>
          <p>With your approval, the repair begins. Service vehicles carry common parts so most jobs finish on the first visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <h3>Performance Verification</h3>
          <p>We verify cool air output, check for proper pressures, confirm thermostat response, and leave you with a post-repair summary.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map -->
  <section class="map-section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Find Us in <span>Ardmore, OK</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Ardmore and southern Oklahoma from Lake Murray Drive.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary)">📍 1704 Lake Murray Dr S, Ardmore, OK 73401</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Serving Ardmore · Lone Grove · Springer · Dickson · Sulphur · Madill and surrounding communities.</p>
      <div class="map-wrap">
        <iframe
          title="AC Repair Ardmore Location"
          src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-97.16%2C34.16%2C-97.12%2C34.19&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=34.1743%2C-97.1436"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>AC Down in Ardmore?</h2>
      <p>Don't suffer through the heat. If your system stopped cooling, is making unusual sounds, or is running nonstop — our team can respond today.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>AC Repair <span>Questions</span></h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Ardmore homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>My AC stopped producing cool air — is this an emergency?</h3>
          <p>Yes, especially during Oklahoma summer heat with kids, elderly residents, or medical needs. Most complete failures trace to a failed capacitor, low refrigerant, tripped breaker, or thermostat. Emergency calls placed earlier in the day are typically completed same-day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How much does AC repair cost in Ardmore?</h3>
          <p>Simple fixes (capacitor, contactor, thermostat) often range from a few hundred dollars. We provide a written estimate before any work begins. Replacement is recommended when the unit is old and repair exceeds roughly 50% of replacement cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you repair both central AC and ductless systems?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We service central air conditioners, heat pumps, ductless mini-splits, and package units from all major brands including Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem, Mitsubishi, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Are you licensed and insured in Oklahoma?</h3>
          <p>Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured technicians familiar with Oklahoma mechanical codes and best practices for AC systems in Ardmore and Carter County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Should I repair or replace my AC?</h3>
          <p>Repair usually makes sense if the unit is under 10–12 years old and the issue is isolated. Replacement is worth evaluating for units 12+ years old, recurring failures, or when repair cost approaches half the value of a new system. We give an honest assessment either way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
